Computer operation package

Permission settings reuse the reviewed Sailry UI from ab5251de:
plugins/builtin/computer/desktop.rs
plugins/builtin/computer/desktop/view.rs
plugins/builtin/computer/desktop/messages.rs
locales/en.yml and locales/zh-CN.yml

Execution uses Open Computer Use from ifuryst/open-computer-use at
8fdda42639c94fa2ce22ea2d9d706b5919a83b42 (MIT), built and packaged by Sailry.
The application packaging notices retain its license and upstream Cua Driver
and yabai notices. Sailry's macOS helper patches scope window and cursor
cleanup to the owning connection and apply the Sailry helper identity.

This package declares the MCP service, instructions, tool display metadata and
permission settings. Native helper selection, protected execution resources,
ordinary approvals, cancellation and media projection stay in the Node.
